# D3-FE-004: A two-stage sugar-to-acid bioprocess
# Simulation candidate; no runtime observations are claimed.
register lv3
add v1 water 60mL @ 30C
add v1 sucrose 0.5g
add v1 dry_yeast 0.5g
seal v1 500mL
wait 8h
inspect
add v1 acetobacter 1g
add v1 O2 0.003mol
wait 24h
measure v1 ph
chromatograph v1
inspect
